sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer as PER-001 (Customer)
    participant Channel as SVC-017<br/>Digital Channels
    participant IAM as SVC-100<br/>IAM
    participant DomPay as SVC-009<br/>Domestic Payments
    participant Retail as SVC-001<br/>Retail Banking Core
    participant EventBus as SVC-102<br/>Event Bus
    participant Sanctions as SVC-051<br/>Sanctions Screening
    participant Fraud as SVC-013<br/>Fraud Detection
    participant Audit as SVC-103<br/>Audit & Logging

    Note over Customer,Audit: PY-001 — Payment Initiation

    Customer->>Channel: Enter payee sort code, account number, name, amount
    Channel->>DomPay: POST /cop/verify {payee_sort_code, payee_account_number, payee_name}
    DomPay-->>Channel: 200 OK {cop_result: match, risk_warning_required: false}
    Channel-->>Customer: Display CoP result: "Payee verified ✓" — prompt SCA

    Customer->>Channel: Complete SCA (FIDO2 biometric — dynamic linking to payee + amount)
    Channel->>IAM: POST /sca/validate {assertion, payee_sort_code, payee_account_number, amount}
    IAM-->>Channel: 200 OK {sca_assertion_ref, valid: true}

    Channel->>Retail: POST /payments {account_id, amount, payee details, cop_result: match, sca_assertion_ref}
    Note right of Retail: Validate: account active, balance OK,<br/>daily limit OK, SCA assertion valid.<br/>Create PaymentIntent (status: pending_screening).
    Retail-->>Channel: 202 Accepted {payment_intent_id, status: pending_screening, poll_url}

    Retail->>EventBus: Publish PaymentIntentCreated (EVT-P01)
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-P01 to WORM audit log
    Channel-->>Customer: Show "Processing your payment..." screen

    Note over Customer,Audit: PY-002 — Pre-Execution Checks (concurrent, async)

    par Sanctions check (< 3s)
        EventBus->>Sanctions: Consume PaymentIntentCreated → run OFSI/UN/EU/OFAC screen
        Sanctions->>EventBus: Publish SanctionsScreeningCompleted (EVT-P02) {outcome: clear}
        EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-P02 to WORM audit log
    and Fraud scoring (< 500ms)
        EventBus->>Fraud: Consume PaymentIntentCreated → run ML fraud scoring
        Fraud->>EventBus: Publish FraudScoreCompleted (EVT-P03) {risk_level: low, fraud_score: 0.05}
        EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-P03 (risk_level only) to audit log
    end

    Note over Customer,Audit: PY-003 — Payment Decision

    EventBus->>Retail: Consume EVT-P02 (clear) + EVT-P03 (low) — both received
    Note right of Retail: Both checks clear → publish PaymentCleared.<br/>Update PaymentIntent.status = processing.
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish PaymentCleared (EVT-P04)
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-P04 to audit log

    Note over Customer,Audit: PY-004 — FPS Execution

    EventBus->>DomPay: Consume PaymentCleared → construct ISO 20022 pacs.008
    Note right of DomPay: Submit pacs.008 to Vocalink FPS.<br/>Create PaymentExecution (ENT-009).
    DomPay->>EventBus: Publish PaymentExecuted (EVT-P05) {fps_reference, settlement_status: accepted}
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-P05 to WORM audit log

    EventBus->>Retail: Consume PaymentExecuted → debit account ledger
    Note right of Retail: Debit account. Update PaymentIntent.status = completed.<br/>Update Account.daily_payment_total.
    Retail->>EventBus: Publish AccountDebited (EVT-P06)
    EventBus->>Audit: Write EVT-P06 to WORM audit log

    Note over Customer,Audit: PY-005 — Confirmation

    Channel->>Retail: GET /payments/{payment_intent_id} (polling)
    Retail-->>Channel: 200 OK {status: completed, fps_reference: "FPS20260415...", completed_at: "..."}
    Channel-->>Customer: Display confirmation: payee name, £amount, FPS reference, timestamp

    Note over Customer,Audit: Total elapsed: < 15 seconds from POST /payments to confirmation render
